1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Forty-Eighth Episode
The Bounty

15
00:02:03,101 --> 00:02:05,661
Put the load on the right!

16
00:02:43,941 --> 00:02:46,250
- It's me!
- I'm opening right away!

17
00:02:58,301 --> 00:03:00,371
Hey, everyone!

18
00:03:05,181 --> 00:03:09,538
If you want to earn a million 
gold in one night, listen to me!

19
00:03:09,581 --> 00:03:11,173
A million?!

20
00:03:11,221 --> 00:03:14,531
- What? Gold?! - Do you know
the Princess of Silverland?

21
00:03:14,581 --> 00:03:17,573
- The one called Sapphire?
- Yeah, exactly her!

22
00:03:17,621 --> 00:03:20,089
She must be kidnapped!
I mean, bring her here alive!

23
00:03:20,141 --> 00:03:22,211
So, friends, what do you say?

24
00:03:22,341 --> 00:03:24,411
For what purpose kidnap her?

25
00:03:24,661 --> 00:03:26,538
No questions, men!

26
00:03:26,581 --> 00:03:29,049
A million gold
to anyone who brings her here!

27
00:03:35,021 --> 00:03:38,252
Tonight, the back entrance
of the castle will not be guarded,

28
00:03:38,301 --> 00:03:40,656
nor locked!
Good luck!

29
00:03:41,701 --> 00:03:43,453
Did you hear how much he offered!

30
00:03:43,501 --> 00:03:45,617
It's still more profitable
than being a pirate.

31
00:04:03,901 --> 00:04:06,290
It's so quiet..
Too quiet!

32
00:04:06,581 --> 00:04:09,414
I fear this silence
is a prelude to something bad.

33
00:04:12,541 --> 00:04:14,611
What's the matter, Princess?

34
00:04:15,421 --> 00:04:17,651
Is that you, Doctor Uranaru?

35
00:04:17,701 --> 00:04:20,169
I can't sleep,
it's too quiet.

36
00:04:20,221 --> 00:04:22,132
Yes, I was thinking the same thing

37
00:04:22,181 --> 00:04:24,854
It’s strange... While I was coming
here, I didn't see in the corridors...

38
00:04:24,901 --> 00:04:27,096
...any soldiers on guard.
How come?

39
00:04:27,141 --> 00:04:29,018
What? No guards?! And why?

40
00:04:30,021 --> 00:04:32,740
Hey, guards! Guards!

41
00:04:33,381 --> 00:04:35,133
Guards!

42
00:04:40,701 --> 00:04:43,295
- It should work.
- Of course it will work!

43
00:04:43,341 --> 00:04:45,172
You’ll see that everything will be fine!

44
00:04:45,501 --> 00:04:46,900
Yeah!

45
00:04:51,541 --> 00:04:54,260
That bounty, we’re definitely
the ones who are going to bag it!

46
00:04:55,941 --> 00:04:59,013
You’ve got it all wrong,
brothers! That loot will be ours!

47
00:04:59,061 --> 00:05:00,813
Get them!

48
00:05:04,541 --> 00:05:07,009
We’ve already got that money
in our pockets! Let's move!

49
00:05:13,101 --> 00:05:15,615
For this job,
you need professionals.

50
00:05:26,301 --> 00:05:28,292
He’s fast asleep!

51
00:05:31,421 --> 00:05:33,810
Damn, she wasn't sleeping!

52
00:05:34,261 --> 00:05:37,173
I was expecting some villains like you! Who are you?

53
00:05:37,221 --> 00:05:39,655
Now that you're awake, we'll have to resort to force.

54
00:05:39,701 --> 00:05:43,011
- Come on!
- Be a good girl, get in the bag!

55
00:05:46,901 --> 00:05:49,620
It's you, Captain Blood! What a pleasure to see you!

56
00:05:49,701 --> 00:05:53,330
Hello, old friend Blood! You want the bounty all for yourself, don't you?

57
00:05:53,901 --> 00:05:55,732
The bounty?!

58
00:05:59,861 --> 00:06:02,580
Thanks, Blood! But what did those two want?

59
00:06:02,861 --> 00:06:04,499
What are you doing?!

60
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:21,331
I brought you Princess Sapphire. Pay me the bounty.

61
00:06:21,780 --> 00:06:23,737
It's really her! Well done!

62
00:06:24,460 --> 00:06:26,417
Here is the bounty.

63
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:32,218
Where am I? What have you done, Captain Blood?

64
00:06:32,260 --> 00:06:34,695
What is this? You know each other?

65
00:06:35,140 --> 00:06:37,450
Why did you hit me earlier?

66
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:39,617
And who might this individual be?

67
00:06:39,660 --> 00:06:42,016
Don't be silly and don't talk to me like that!

68
00:06:42,060 --> 00:06:44,177
- It bothers me!
- Captain Blood is right!

69
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:46,451
You ask too many questions and you're too arrogant!

70
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:48,857
But Captain Blood...

71
00:06:48,900 --> 00:06:51,017
Now that I've collected the bounty that was on you,

72
00:06:51,060 --> 00:06:53,017
you no longer interest me! Goodbye!

73
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:55,251
Wait, Captain!
I'm coming with you!

74
00:06:55,300 --> 00:06:58,020
- You aren't going anywhere!
- What?!

75
00:06:58,220 --> 00:07:01,019
What do you want?
Why can't I leave?

76
00:07:01,940 --> 00:07:04,216
You will stay with us for three days.

77
00:07:04,260 --> 00:07:06,297
- That's why!
- Three days with you?!

78
00:07:49,820 --> 00:07:52,335
Damn it!
What are these explosions?

79
00:07:55,020 --> 00:07:57,137
There must be something on the bottom!

80
00:09:16,901 --> 00:09:18,653
But this is a workshop!

81
00:09:37,261 --> 00:09:40,697
Listen to me well! Did
you hear the explosions?

82
00:09:40,741 --> 00:09:43,016
That means the tests were successful!

83
00:09:43,061 --> 00:09:45,894
You will bring the gunpowder
to Silverland in several trips!

84
00:09:45,941 --> 00:09:49,650
You must bring all the powder
to Silverland by tomorrow evening!

85
00:09:49,701 --> 00:09:52,090
The day after tomorrow, or at noon
on the third day,

86
00:09:52,141 --> 00:09:55,213
we will set off the powder
and blow up the entire city.

87
00:09:55,301 --> 00:10:00,421
Rest assured that we will destroy
the entire kingdom of Silverland!

88
00:10:10,701 --> 00:10:14,171
What do you say? Doesn't this
official notice seem like a good idea?

89
00:10:14,221 --> 00:10:16,735
Yes, not bad...
It will place upon Sapphire...

90
00:10:16,781 --> 00:10:19,534
...all the blame for the disasters
that will occur!

91
00:10:19,581 --> 00:10:21,572
You're right, it will be a laugh!

92
00:10:25,301 --> 00:10:28,850
It says that they will build
an amusement park for children!

93
00:10:28,901 --> 00:10:31,813
All the buildings located
in this area will be destroyed.

94
00:10:31,861 --> 00:10:35,297
Anyone who does not obey the order
will be sentenced to death on the spot!

95
00:10:35,341 --> 00:10:37,218
The signature
is Princess Sapphire's!

96
00:10:49,901 --> 00:10:53,814
Our houses! What cruelty!
It was she herself who ordered it!

97
00:10:53,861 --> 00:10:57,410
She's tearing down our houses just
to make an amusement park!

98
00:10:57,621 --> 00:10:59,737
Whatever has gotten into her?!

99
00:10:59,781 --> 00:11:02,932
I didn't expect this
from Princess Sapphire!

100
00:11:04,421 --> 00:11:07,777
Where will we live, now that
our houses are destroyed?

101
00:11:41,661 --> 00:11:43,617
- Hey, Sapphire!
- Who is calling me?

102
00:11:43,661 --> 00:11:45,617
I thought I heard
Blood's voice!

103
00:11:45,661 --> 00:11:48,334
Ah, it's you!
What have you come here to do?

104
00:11:49,021 --> 00:11:50,739
Silence!

105
00:11:59,021 --> 00:12:02,775
What was that noise out there?
I want to know what happened!

106
00:12:06,421 --> 00:12:08,491
Boss, I caught this man

107
00:12:08,541 --> 00:12:11,009
...who was walking
in front of Sapphire's room.

108
00:12:11,181 --> 00:12:13,775
- Captain Blood!
- Yes, it's me:

109
00:12:13,821 --> 00:12:17,018
- Captain Blood, the pirate!
- Damn!

110
00:12:17,061 --> 00:12:19,529
Hey, boss, wait a moment!
I came here...

111
00:12:19,581 --> 00:12:22,015
...because I would like to change
my line of work.

112
00:12:22,061 --> 00:12:24,734
You don't earn much
being a pirate.

113
00:12:24,781 --> 00:12:26,692
I think you understand me

114
00:12:26,741 --> 00:12:29,813
Good!
Then have Sapphire come here!

115
00:12:35,621 --> 00:12:39,216
An "X"! You belong
to Union X, as I suspected!

116
00:12:39,261 --> 00:12:41,217
Why did you bring me here?

117
00:12:41,261 --> 00:12:43,616
Go on, tell me what
your evil plan is!

118
00:12:43,661 --> 00:12:47,290
You amuse me! I was told
that you are a spirited girl!

119
00:12:47,341 --> 00:12:50,139
Tell me, though:
do you know this man or not?

120
00:12:50,741 --> 00:12:54,654
Captain Blood! How did you
know that they brought me here?

121
00:12:55,141 --> 00:12:57,814
I really thought
that you had sold me!

122
00:12:58,821 --> 00:13:01,289
But who the hell are you?
I’ve never seen you, brat!

123
00:13:01,341 --> 00:13:03,650
Haven't you realized
yet? I don’t know you!

124
00:13:03,701 --> 00:13:06,010
You’re mistaking me
for someone else!

125
00:13:07,661 --> 00:13:09,413
Wait!

126
00:13:09,621 --> 00:13:12,772
Blood, I can’t believe
that you’ve betrayed me!

127
00:13:12,941 --> 00:13:16,138
I have a feeling that something
terrible is about to happen!

128
00:13:16,421 --> 00:13:18,696
Open up! Open up, quickly!

129
00:13:18,741 --> 00:13:21,016
I have nothing to do with
the Princess of Silverland...

130
00:13:21,061 --> 00:13:23,621
...or whoever she is!
I just want to stay with you...

131
00:13:23,661 --> 00:13:25,731
...and have the money!
- I will satisfy you!

132
00:13:25,781 --> 00:13:28,011
I think you can be useful to me.

133
00:13:28,061 --> 00:13:30,336
You two, escort him
to the laboratory!

134
00:13:36,021 --> 00:13:38,854
Haven't you learned
not to trust yet?

135
00:13:39,621 --> 00:13:41,851
Hey, what nonsense is this?

136
00:13:48,381 --> 00:13:51,293
Union X is not
as naive as you think.

137
00:13:51,341 --> 00:13:54,890
We don't trust you,
so you will stay there all night.

138
00:14:10,101 --> 00:14:13,696
Princess, you have exceeded
the limits of our patience!

139
00:14:13,741 --> 00:14:16,494
- This is too much now!
- It's true, he's right!

140
00:14:18,021 --> 00:14:21,013
I feel sorry for you, people!
You're right to be angry!

141
00:14:21,061 --> 00:14:23,529
The Princess must be crazy
for having ordered...

142
00:14:23,581 --> 00:14:26,254
...sweeping away the houses to make
room for an amusement park!

143
00:14:26,301 --> 00:14:28,292
She cannot treat
her subjects like this,

144
00:14:28,341 --> 00:14:31,014
who have always respected
and revered her on every occasion!

145
00:14:31,061 --> 00:14:34,736
However... you must respect
this official ordinance,

146
00:14:34,781 --> 00:14:37,659
otherwise you will be imprisoned
and your assets confiscated!

147
00:14:37,701 --> 00:14:40,693
Oh, poor people of Silverland!
How you are being harassed!

148
00:14:44,181 --> 00:14:46,012
Nylon is a good actor!

149
00:14:46,061 --> 00:14:48,700
The gunpowder will arrive
in town this afternoon,

150
00:14:48,741 --> 00:14:51,574
so they will blow up
what remains of Silverland.

151
00:14:51,621 --> 00:14:53,896
Naturally,
it will be easy for Union X..

152
00:14:53,941 --> 00:14:57,172
to conquer the kingdom of Silverland,
reduced to a pile of rubble!

153
00:14:57,901 --> 00:14:59,732
Grand Duke Duralumin!

154
00:15:00,901 --> 00:15:03,813
Greetings to you,
my most gracious Queen!

155
00:15:03,861 --> 00:15:06,819
Is it true that Sapphire has given orders
to tear down many houses in town,

156
00:15:06,861 --> 00:15:09,011
to make room
for an amusement park?

157
00:15:09,061 --> 00:15:11,894
Yes, exactly so, Your Majesty!
Now the Princess, your daughter...

158
00:15:11,941 --> 00:15:15,013
...is inspecting the work and
said she would not return...

159
00:15:15,061 --> 00:15:17,894
- until it is finished.
- Oh, woe is us!

160
00:15:18,821 --> 00:15:21,096
I cannot believe she
would do such a thing.

161
00:15:21,141 --> 00:15:23,132
I would like to ask her personally.

162
00:15:23,181 --> 00:15:26,093
What could have happened
to her? Sapphire, come home!

163
00:15:26,181 --> 00:15:30,538
Let me out! Open up!
What do you intend to do?

164
00:15:30,581 --> 00:15:32,811
You will not conquer Silverland!

165
00:15:33,141 --> 00:15:37,373
Father! Mother! Forgive
me! Forgive my helplessness!

166
00:15:42,821 --> 00:15:45,210
Quick, open the
underwater tunnel!

167
00:15:45,261 --> 00:15:49,334
We must bring the gunpowder
to Silverland within an hour!

168
00:16:12,501 --> 00:16:14,537
The prisoner is breaking free!

169
00:16:20,701 --> 00:16:24,011
The man hasn't been born yet
who can put Captain Blood in a cage!

170
00:16:46,501 --> 00:16:50,130
Who is that bastard throwing
dynamite into the fortress?

171
00:16:51,581 --> 00:16:54,015
Sapphire! Quick!
I've come to save you!

172
00:16:56,101 --> 00:16:58,012
Captain Blood!

173
00:16:58,781 --> 00:17:01,534
- Thank you for coming.
- Come on, we must hurry!

174
00:17:01,581 --> 00:17:03,651
Now I'll free you from your chain!

175
00:17:06,741 --> 00:17:09,414
They want to destroy what
remains of the city of Silverland...

176
00:17:09,461 --> 00:17:11,531
...with gunpowder!
- What?!

177
00:17:11,581 --> 00:17:14,015
We must escape
quickly from this place!

178
00:17:14,501 --> 00:17:16,890
Don't let that bastard escape!

179
00:17:16,941 --> 00:17:19,171
Catch him and feed
him to the sharks!

180
00:17:19,221 --> 00:17:21,689
A million gold reward
to whoever finds Sapphire!

181
00:17:21,741 --> 00:17:23,333
This way!

182
00:17:23,941 --> 00:17:27,013
- There they are!
- Let's get them!

183
00:17:41,661 --> 00:17:44,095
Captain Blood, you
were putting on an act...

184
00:17:44,141 --> 00:17:46,814
...to discover the true intentions
of Union X, weren't you?

185
00:17:46,861 --> 00:17:50,410
Of course! I did all this for
you and for your kingdom.

186
00:17:50,821 --> 00:17:53,255
Now listen to me, Sapphire:
get out of here and run...

187
00:17:53,301 --> 00:17:56,134
...to Silverland, to prevent
the city from being destroyed.

188
00:17:57,141 --> 00:18:00,099
- And what will you do, Captain?
- Don't worry about me.

189
00:18:00,141 --> 00:18:02,450
First of all, you must save
your country.

190
00:18:03,661 --> 00:18:05,811
All right! Thank you, Blood!

191
00:18:12,101 --> 00:18:16,014
Damn it! Is it possible that you
still haven't caught those two?!

192
00:18:17,941 --> 00:18:20,216
- I'm here!
- What the hell!

193
00:18:20,461 --> 00:18:22,736
Hey, you don't scare me!

194
00:18:22,781 --> 00:18:25,898
I can take down all of you by
myself, henchmen of Union X!

195
00:18:25,941 --> 00:18:28,694
You let Sapphire escape,
you damned imbecile!

196
00:18:28,741 --> 00:18:31,858
- I won't forgive you for this!
- Come at me, come on!

197
00:18:33,581 --> 00:18:37,733
What are you waiting for? Come
on, you have to take him out!

198
00:18:39,621 --> 00:18:42,579
Hurry, Sapphire! I'll take
care of stopping them!

199
00:19:07,261 --> 00:19:09,252
Look,
that's gunpowder!

200
00:19:09,301 --> 00:19:12,293
They want to blow up the
houses with that! We'll blow up too!

201
00:19:23,101 --> 00:19:25,740
We have placed
all the powder, sir.

202
00:19:26,101 --> 00:19:29,650
Great! Soldier, now all
that's left is to light the fuses!

203
00:19:29,701 --> 00:19:31,419
Come on, get to it!

204
00:19:49,181 --> 00:19:51,570
Hey, you! Stop! Where are you going?

205
00:19:53,821 --> 00:19:56,176
Let's get her! It's the Princess!

206
00:19:57,581 --> 00:19:59,139
Good heavens!

207
00:20:02,541 --> 00:20:04,816
It will be a disaster
if I don't hurry!

208
00:20:15,501 --> 00:20:17,332
Go, Opal!

209
00:20:29,701 --> 00:20:32,499
Look! Princess Sapphire
is cutting the fuses!

210
00:20:32,541 --> 00:20:35,009
But hadn't he ordered
to blow up the city?

211
00:20:35,061 --> 00:20:38,451
But it's... That... it's Sapphire!
It really is Sapphire, damn it!

212
00:20:41,181 --> 00:20:43,900
Nylon, who ordered the
blowing up of the houses?

213
00:20:43,941 --> 00:20:46,899
But... But... But you signed the
official ordinance yourself, didn't you?

214
00:20:47,581 --> 00:20:50,459
- The official ordinance?!
- Well done, Sapphire!

215
00:20:50,501 --> 00:20:52,492
You arrived in time and
you managed to prevent..

216
00:20:52,541 --> 00:20:55,897
. ...the destruction of Silverland!
- You made it too!

217
00:20:56,821 --> 00:21:00,894
Yes, I made it! I want to tell you
one thing, citizens of Silverland!

218
00:21:01,141 --> 00:21:04,292
It was those from Union X
who planted the gunpowder!

219
00:21:04,341 --> 00:21:07,572
Now let's move against them
and let's finish them all off together!

220
00:21:07,621 --> 00:21:09,452
Yes!

221
00:21:09,901 --> 00:21:12,779
Free me, Princess! What
do you intend to do with me?

222
00:21:12,821 --> 00:21:16,257
You will stay where you are until I
have cleared up the doubts about you.

223
00:21:19,821 --> 00:21:22,016
Damn it, they're attacking us!

224
00:21:22,381 --> 00:21:24,690
At them! At them!

225
00:21:25,901 --> 00:21:28,813
Let's kill them all! At them!

226
00:21:29,021 --> 00:21:31,694
Let's get them! At them!

227
00:21:33,461 --> 00:21:36,419
Wait! Wait, you idiots!

228
00:21:36,461 --> 00:21:39,817
Don't run away! Come back!
Fight!

229
00:21:40,901 --> 00:21:43,620
Damn it!
They escaped on the carts!

230
00:21:55,901 --> 00:21:58,699
Curse it! You bunch of cowards!

231
00:21:58,741 --> 00:22:00,493
Damn it!

232
00:22:09,741 --> 00:22:12,209
But look at him! Too bad for him!

233
00:22:12,421 --> 00:22:14,889
The cart is speeding away with him on it!

234
00:22:15,661 --> 00:22:19,370
What happened?
Why wasn't there an explosion?

235
00:22:20,901 --> 00:22:23,540
But what is this earthquake?!

236
00:22:23,581 --> 00:22:25,617
Damn it!

237
00:22:32,901 --> 00:22:36,450
The island! The island is sinking!

238
00:22:36,501 --> 00:22:40,016
Who knows what caused
all this upheaval!

239
00:22:40,621 --> 00:22:43,533
Damn it,
my whole plan has failed!

240
00:22:43,581 --> 00:22:45,572
Poor me!

241
00:23:03,021 --> 00:23:07,014
Princess Sapphire! We are
all extremely grateful to you!

242
00:23:07,061 --> 00:23:10,019
You have saved our city
from destruction!

243
00:23:10,061 --> 00:23:12,131
We cannot celebrate
victory yet!

244
00:23:12,181 --> 00:23:15,059
The Union X army
is approaching us.

245
00:23:15,221 --> 00:23:18,133
But listen:
only if we work together

246
00:23:18,181 --> 00:23:20,854
...all united for the protection
of our homeland,

247
00:23:20,901 --> 00:23:22,892
will we succeed in defeating
our enemies.

248
00:23:22,941 --> 00:23:25,057
It is our only chance of salvation.

249
